    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9780" root="حيل" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَالَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحِيلُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُيُولٌ</span> <i>It became
altered,</i> or <i>changed:</i> (K:) a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حال</span>,
aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحُولُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُؤُولٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حال المَآءُ</span>,
aor. as above, <i>The water remained,</i> or <i>stagnated,
and collected;</i> or <i>remained long, and became
altered;</i> or <i>became yellow and altered;</i> in the
bottom of a valley. (TA.)

